From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP tolerate missing holders on a registered cut

Corridor unload drops Moonrise holders in the hole. Ticket FULL-load on
the kept side then checkNeighbour-throws Missing chunkholder. Treat a
registered cut as an intentional gap: do not schedule gen into it, and
reuse the center holder in the neighbour cache. Carve stays on.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkTaskScheduler.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkTaskScheduler.java
@@ -772,7 +772,16 @@
         final List<NewChunkHolder> chunkHolderNeighbours = new ArrayList<>((2 * neighbourReadRadius + 1) * (2 * neighbourReadRadius + 1));
         final StaticCache2D<GenerationChunkHolder> neighbours = StaticCache2D
                 .create(chunkX, chunkZ, neighbourReadRadius, (final int nx, final int nz) -> {
-                    final NewChunkHolder holder = nx == chunkX && nz == chunkZ ? chunkHolder : this.chunkHolderManager.getChunkHolder(nx, nz);
+                    NewChunkHolder holder = nx == chunkX && nz == chunkZ ? chunkHolder : this.chunkHolderManager.getChunkHolder(nx, nz);
+                    if (holder == null
+                            && io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(this.world, nx, nz)) {
+                        // Legal empty-buffer cut: no holder in the hole. Reuse the center so FULL
+                        // load on the kept side does not NPE / Missing chunkholder.
+                        holder = chunkHolder;
+                    }
+                    if (holder == null) {
+                        throw new IllegalStateException("Missing chunkholder when required");
+                    }
                     chunkHolderNeighbours.add(holder);
 
                     return holder.vanillaChunkHolder;
@@ -795,6 +804,11 @@
         final NewChunkHolder chunkHolder = this.chunkHolderManager.getChunkHolder(chunkX, chunkZ);
 
         if (chunkHolder == null) {
+            if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(this.world, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
+                // Corridor unload dropped the holder. Do not schedule gen into the hole;
+                // treat the gap as already at the required status so the kept side can FULL-load.
+                return false;
+            }
             throw new IllegalStateException("Missing chunkholder when required");
         }
 

